{"speciesId":465,"names":{"fr":"Bouldeneu","es":"Tangrowth","en":"Tangrowth","ja":"モジャンボ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It ensnares prey by extending arms made of vines. Losing arms to predators does not trouble it."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It ensnares prey by extending arms made of vines. Losing arms to predators does not trouble it."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Its arms are made of plants that bind themselves to things. They grow back right away if cut."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"When it remains still, it appears to be a large shrub. Unsuspecting prey that wander near get ensnared by its vines."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its vines grow so profusely that, in the warm season, you can’t even see its eyes."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Ses bras sont en fait des plantes qui s’attachent à tout ce qu’elles touchent et peuvent repousser."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its arms are made of plants that bind themselves to things. They grow back right away if cut."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ses bras sont en fait des plantes qui s’attachent à tout ce qu’elles touchent et peuvent repousser."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Its arms are made of plants that bind themselves to things. They grow back right away if cut."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Even if one of its arms is eaten, it’s fine. The Pokémon regenerates quickly and will go right back to normal."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Even if one of its arms is eaten, it’s fine. The Pokémon regenerates quickly and will go right back to normal."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il ligote sa proie en étirant ses bras en lianes. Il ne craint pas de perdre un bras face à un ennemi."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Atrapa a su presa desplegando las ramas de sus brazos, que no le importa perder ante depredadores."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It ensnares prey by extending arms made of vines. Losing arms to predators does not trouble it."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"植物の ツルで できた 腕を 伸ばして 獲物を 絡め取る。 腕を 食べられても へっちゃら。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Lorsque vient la belle saison, ses lianes sont si luxuriantes qu’elles cachent ses yeux."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Cuando llega el calor, se cubre por completo con sus lianas y no se le pueden ver ni los ojos."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Its vines grow so profusely that, in the warm season, you can’t even see its eyes."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"暖かい 季節に なると 目玉も 隠れてしまうほど 植物の ツルが 伸び続ける。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il ligote sa proie en étirant ses bras en lianes. Il ne craint pas de perdre un bras face à un ennemi."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Atrapa a su presa desplegando las ramas de sus brazos, que no le importa perder ante depredadores."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It ensnares prey by extending arms made of vines. Losing arms to predators does not trouble it."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"植物の ツルで できた 腕を 伸ばして 獲物を 絡め取る。 腕を 食べられても へっちゃら。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Lorsque vient la belle saison, ses lianes sont si luxuriantes qu’elles cachent ses yeux."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Cuando llega el calor, se cubre por completo con sus lianas y no se le pueden ver ni los ojos."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Its vines grow so profusely that, in the warm season, you can’t even see its eyes."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"暖かい 季節に なると 目玉も 隠れてしまうほど 植物の ツルが 伸び続ける。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"La science a récemment découvert que les deux bras qu’il peut allonger à volonté sont en fait des lianes entrelacées."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Se ha descubierto recientemente que los dos brazos que estira a voluntad son en realidad lianas enredadas entre sí."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Tangrowth has two arms that it can extend as it pleases. Recent research has shown that these arms are, in fact, bundles of vines."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"自在に 伸びる ２本の 腕は じつは ツルが 束になったものと 最近の 研究で わかった。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ses lianes poussent plus rapidement s’il vit sous un climat chaud. Quand elles deviennent trop longues, il se les coupe."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Las lianas le crecen más rápidamente si vive en regiones cálidas. Cuando alcanzan cierta longitud, se las corta."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Vine growth is accelerated for Tangrowth living in warm climates. If the vines grow long, Tangrowth shortens them by tearing parts of them off."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"暖かい 土地で 暮らす ものほど ツルの 伸びが 早い。 伸びると 自ら ちぎって 短くする。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Draped with long vines, it resembles a shrub in appearance. It swings bundles of vines as though they were arms, wrapping them around prey to ensnare them."}],"varieties":[{"id":465,"moves":[{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"bind","learns":[[8,"level-up",22],[9,"level-up",22],[10,"level-up",22],[11,"level-up",22],[14,"level-up",17],[14,"tutor",0],[15,"level-up",17],[16,"level-up",17],[16,"tutor",0],[17,"level-up",17],[18,"level-up",17],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"slam","learns":[[8,"level-up",43],[9,"level-up",43],[10,"level-up",43],[11,"level-up",43],[14,"level-up",43],[15,"level-up",43